SUMMARY:Whiskey & Wings
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Father’s Day with an evening of bold flavors and relaxed\, social energy. Enjoy educational whiskey tastings paired with a lineup of specialty wings\, from classic buffalo to Carolina Gold BBQ and sweet heat favorites. Explore pairing notes\, sample your way through stations\, and settle into a laid-back lounge atmosphere with live music. It’s the perfect night out for dads who love good food and great whiskey. \nThis event is ages 21+! \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
