SUMMARY:Annual Juneteenth Celebration at Montclair Brewery
DESCRIPTION:Don’t miss the start of the weekend-long Juneteenth celebration! Over the course of the weekend\, enjoy tasty food by local food vendors\, live music\, and special activities. There will be a $10 cover charge per person for each live music performance this weekend.\nFriday\, 6/19 \nChow down on boneless jerk chicken\, curry goat\, oxtail\, festival\, and island slaw —high-energy\, crowd-pleasing plates from Prepped For You that pair beautifully with craft beer out in the Beer Garden from 5-10pm. \nMove your body to Reggae\, Soca\, Calypso\, and more by the experts of Caribbean music\, 5 Outa 12\, from 7-10pm! \nSaturday\, 6/20 \nSavor each bite of slow-smoked\, authentic Southern BBQ\, Texas brisket\, North Carolina pulled pork\, Memphis ribs and wings by Kinfolk BBQ! \nJam out to live music with an R&B twist by the popular Funk/Blues band Lil’ Bastad! Groove to their funky tunes from 7-10pm. \nSunday\, 6/21 \nEnjoy a unique fashion show featuring the boutique Velvet Lush\, Anacia Sessoms\, and Sofistafunk with DJ Ritters! Watch the models strut their stuff down the walkway out in the Beer Garden from 1-3pm. \nCreate your next favorite brew and chew combo from 3-8pm with smoked BBQ\, warm pita sandwiches\, platters with options like salmon\, chicken\, pork\, and vegan\, tasty sides like collard greens\, mac n cheese\, coleslaw\, and more by Gray’s Area Grille! \nFeel the best of the best Blues music performed live from 5:30-7:30pm by New Jersey Blues Hall of Fame inductees BBD Rhythm and Blues\, a tight-knit band of veteran musicians who have performed all across the country since the late ’70s. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/annual-juneteenth-celebration-at-montclair-brewery-2/
LOCATION:Montclair Brewery\, 101 Walnut Street\, Montclair\, NJ\, 07042\, United States
CATEGORIES:Community,Entertainment,Food,General Events,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://montclairlocal.news/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Juneteenth-Weekend-Celebration-social-1080-x-1080-px-1.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Brewery":MAILTO:Staff@montclairbrewery.com
END:VEVENT
