SUMMARY:Sock Monster Live at Tierney's
DESCRIPTION:Come celebrate the summer solstice with Sock Monster this Saturday\, June 20th\, upstairs at Tierney’s in Montclair! Just like the heathens who came before them\, the band promises to set the stage ablaze with their mix of classics and indie/alt faves\, from the ‘60s right up to the now sound of today. Wild dancing will certainly break out to the mix of smart punk/pop hits from the likes of the Kinks\, Badfinger\, Cheap Trick\, Cure\, Squeeze\, and Replacements\, and will likely last well into the shortest night of the year! No ritual toasts are planned\, but the cheap beer will be flowing\, and the band’s been known to start off the night knocking back tequila shots. If you’ve got feasting on the brain\, Tierney’s is widely recognized for serving one of the best burgers in Montclair\, so grab one downstairs before the show or bring it up while the band’s playing. Sock Monster is JP Uva\, guitar/keys/vocals; Jim Kvoriak\, guitar/vocals; Bob Terhune\, bass/vocals; and Andy Yeates\, drums. They’ve added new songs into the mix\, guaranteed to please the Guitar Gods. So come out and party like your pagan ancestors—start summer off with a bang! \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/sock-monster-live-at-tierneys-2/
LOCATION:Tierney’s Tavern\, 136 Valley Road\, Montclair\, NJ\, 07042\, United States
