SUMMARY:"Cats" in the Garden - Jaguar Show at Van Vleck
DESCRIPTION:This popular Father’s Day event brings families from all over to admire the classic and contemporary Jaguar automobiles placed throughout historic Van Vleck Gardens. The event is organized by the Jaguar Touring Club of New Jersey. \nAdmission is $10 cash per person at the gate\, kids under age 10 may enter free of charge. There is no registration for this event. The rain date is the following Sunday\, June 28 at the same time. \nPlease contact Paul Maletsky of the Jaguar Touring Club if you have questions about the Club. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
