SUMMARY:The Wedding Banquet (2025): Laugh Out Loud Pride Film Screening NEW
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a FREE screening of the Sundance 2025 winner\, The Wedding Banquet\, to celebrate Pride this year at Montclair Public Library! The screening will be followed by a open panel discussion about the film featuring Ruth Roe from AAPI NJ and FDU Professor Cordelia Siporin. Free popcorn will be provided by The Claridge. These screenings are proudly co-presented by Pride Center of Montclair. Come join in the fun and bring a friend! \n“A gay man makes a deal with his lesbian friend: a green-card marriage for him in exchange for in vitro fertilization treatments for her. Plans evolve as the groom’s grandmother arrives in California to surprise them with a Korean wedding banquet.” \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
