UID:10139968-1782500400-1782507600@montclairlocal.news
SUMMARY:Game Night: A Very Fey Drag Dungeons & Dragons
DESCRIPTION:Adventurers! Join us for a fun and fantastical one shot D&D campaign\, facilitated by a magically whimsical Drag Dungeon Master. We embrace the quirky\, the chaotic\, and the downright silly. No experience necessary\, we welcome players of all skill levels. We’re all about having a good laugh and creating unforgettable memories together. Players aged 16 and up are welcome to play. This is a safe space for all\, including LGBTQIA+ and Neurodiverse folk. \nPlayers will be playing the one shot The Solstice Gala: Welcome\, Dear Players\, to the Seelie court’s Solstice Gala! Perhaps you’re a ranger or warlock who has harbored favor with an Archfey. Maybe you’re a native to the Fey wild looking to celebrate the Endless Sun. It’s possible\, even\, that you’re a mortal who has been whisked away and replaced by a changeling… who forgot they had a ticket to the Seelie Court’s largest party and now you’re filling their seat. Whatever the reason\, you have earned your way into Titania’s banquet celebrating the Fey Solstice\, when the Seelie Court welcomes continuous sun for the next century (in Fey time\, of course). Chaos is sure to ensue– it’s the Feywild\, after all. \nWe will be playing a fully home brewed one shot in D&D 5e with an emphasis on roleplaying. Characters are welcome to be any level 5-8 and we will be using the point buy system to build our sheets. While it may be tempting to play a level 8 bard with max charisma for a social one shot\, remember playing a low level fighter who can’t string elegance together to save their life might bring its own unique challenges and fun. We welcome you to the Feywild and hope you try the food and enjoy your stay! \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/game-night-a-very-fey-drag-dungeons-dragons/
